(text "Two identical LED leaves. J1: GND/VLED/THIS/OTHER. J2: GND/VLED/OTHER/THIS.\nController J3 carries independent left/right streams. Cable1 to left J1; cable2 from left J2 to right J1.\nThe final right J2 remains unused. Both completed SH4 cables are straight1:1." (at 20 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "45d71a0b-97fe-5afd-af4d-1c2118dec515"))
